
 # EveryDay Git

  Command	What it does

  git status -	What's changed, staged vs unstaged

  git add file / git add . -	Stage changes

  git commit -m "message" -	Commit staged changes

  git push origin branch-name	- Push to remote

  git pull	- Fetch + merge from remote

  git fetch -	Download remote changes without merging

  git checkout -b feature/xyz -	Create + switch to a new branch

  git switch feature/xyz	- Switch branches (newer, clearer than checkout)

  git branch -d feature/xyz	- Delete a local branch
  git log --oneline --graph --all	- Compact visual commit history

  git diff -	Unstaged changes vs last commit

  git diff --staged	- Staged changes vs last commit